 "lanes": [],
 "notes": "Campaign-style player vs AI. Survivors hold a walled home in the south-west with one 6-wide choke east; the 16-tile natural sits in a plaza right outside it. A second 16-tile field, the South Yard, lies in a plaza down the y=59 street next to a plague zone: Survivor-leaning but open to raids from the east. The Horde holds the corrupted north-east: sludge pools, dead trees, craters and three big plague zones around the Hive. The Angel Wreck sits on the Horde side of the map centre, in a plaza touching the 6-radius plague zone: the richest field, in the Horde's healing ground.",
